WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.397 --> 00:00:04.486
Unit seventeen. Emotions and Expressing Feelings!

2
00:00:05.486 --> 00:00:10.927
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:14.625
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:14.675 --> 00:00:19.986
Today we learn: Emotions and Expressing Feelings. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.111 --> 00:00:24.561
Feel. Say it with me. Feel!

6
00:00:28.044 --> 00:00:31.861
Nervous. Say it with me. Nervous!

7
00:00:35.363 --> 00:00:39.046
Confident. Say it with me. Confident!

8
00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:45.763
Calm. Say it with me. Calm!

9
00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:53.247
Frustrated. Say it with me. Frustrated!

10
00:00:56.746 --> 00:01:00.213
Relieved. Say it with me. Relieved!

11
00:01:03.715 --> 00:01:07.798
Express. Say it with me. Express!

12
00:01:11.307 --> 00:01:15.490
Understand. Say it with me. Understand!

13
00:01:18.966 --> 00:01:27.864
Grammar time! I feel + adjective + when, . Listen. I feel nervous when I speak in public.

14
00:01:27.914 --> 00:01:33.096
Your turn. Say it with me. I feel nervous when I speak in public.

15
00:01:38.275 --> 00:01:54.473
Everyone feels different emotions every day. Sometimes I feel nervous before a test, but I try to stay calm. When something is hard, I might feel frustrated, but I feel relieved once it's done. It's important to express your feelings so others can understand you.

16
00:01:54.523 --> 00:01:55.833
I like this story!

17
00:01:56.585 --> 00:02:01.876
Look! What's the word?

18
00:02:01.926 --> 00:02:03.076
Confident!

19
00:02:03.986 --> 00:02:09.255
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:09.305 --> 00:02:10.455
Express!

21
00:02:11.717 --> 00:02:21.710
Think and answer. How do you usually feel before a big test, and what helps you calm down?

22
00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:22.910
Great answer!

23
00:02:24.022 --> 00:02:27.170
This unit's value is Self-Awareness.

24
00:02:27.220 --> 00:02:29.241
I can show self-awareness every day!

25
00:02:29.938 --> 00:02:34.361
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
00:02:34.411 --> 00:02:35.980
Bye-bye, friends!

